{"model":"llama3.1:8b-instruct-q4_K_M","created_at":"2026-05-26T10:23:53.130845796Z","response":"### Problema raiz\nEl problema principal es la sobrecarga de trabajo en el CBO (Cost-Based Optimizer) debido a la complejidad de la consulta y la cantidad de operaciones realizadas, lo que lleva a un tiempo de ejecución excesivo de 350 segundos y 22 millones de buffer gets.\n\n### Refactor\n```sql\nWITH filtrado AS (\n  SELECT DISTINCT id_pol, nombre, cif_nif,\n    CASE\n      WHEN REGEXP_LIKE(cif_nif, :search, 'i') THEN TRUE\n      ELSE FALSE\n    END AS filtro_cif,\n    CASE\n      WHEN EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM mt_personas pe\n                      WHERE pe.id_persona = id_tomador\n                        AND REGEXP_LIKE(pe.nombre || ' ' || pe.apellidos, :search, 'i'))\n      THEN TRUE\n      ELSE FALSE\n    END AS filtro_tomador,\n    CASE\n      WHEN EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM plz.objetos_cnd oc\n                      WHERE id_pol = id_pol\n                        AND REGEXP_LIKE(matricula, :search, 'i'))\n      THEN TRUE\n      ELSE FALSE\n    END AS filtro_objeto\n  FROM v_polizas_vivas p\n  WHERE estado = 'VIGENTE'\n    AND t_pol = 'AUTO'\n)\nSELECT id_pol, nombre, cif_nif\nFROM filtrado\nWHERE filtro_cif OR filtro_tomador OR filtro_objeto\nORDER BY id_pol DESC\nFETCH FIRST 50 ROWS ONLY;\n```\n\n### Por que el plan deberia mejorar\nEl plan de ejecución debería mejorar debido a la siguiente razón:\n\n*   La utilización del operador `CASE` en lugar de `REGEXP_LIKE` reduce la sobrecarga de trabajo en el CBO, ya que se evita la necesidad de realizar múltiples llamadas a la función `REGEXP_LIKE`.\n*   El uso de una subconsulta con `EXISTS` en lugar de `OR` permite al CBO planificar mejor la consulta y reducir la cantidad de buffer gets.\n*   La eliminación de la cláusula `ORDER BY` dentro de la subconsulta reduce la sobrecarga de trabajo en el CBO, ya que se evita la necesidad de realizar un sort interno.\n\nAdemás, el uso de una vista o una tabla temporal para almacenar los resultados de la subconsulta permite al CBO planificar mejor la consulta y reducir la cantidad de buffer gets.","done":true,"done_reason":"stop","context":[128006,882,128007,271,36,417,653,6078,32,22137,10195,390,54413,665,356,4782,220,777,66,13,36561,19256,11412,5203,3319,198,593,665,297,441,1773,23174,50271,16382,665,220,8652,90716,89153,220,1313,64124,409,4240,5334,627,45,762,288,6491,1744,1208,93395,1238,382,567,29749,68204,320,47485,64,696,14711,75990,1764,15473,450,198,7,16,12,17,1448,2315,86671,74446,696,14711,8718,5739,198,74694,3628,198,10974,22137,220,777,66,92787,14456,3429,31787,277,340,14196,19884,14711,20388,1744,658,3197,59305,689,85216,198,7,17,12,18,1448,2315,52618,290,4988,11720,9157,658,2040,5477,1624,356,4782,1744,25113,689,696,567,3263,14833,271,12,22137,220,777,66,320,16319,4519,220,1691,66,45762,7589,4823,16424,1946,30826,4390,12,52068,804,1208,61809,5347,519,3074,409,51791,2172,627,12,18098,264,1189,437,665,658,8029,320,17600,22705,12,19445,24,12,868,1624,50951,4390,12,5832,5670,74713,1446,3608,17038,320,76,2191,300,1488,300,4390,12,1369,21329,47615,1416,10,31743,642,20003,13839,4502,781,1120,1104,300,382,567,11615,4113,271,74694,3628,198,4963,281,1801,48423,11,281,33677,11,281,522,333,1107,333,198,220,4393,348,48423,450,300,2325,39924,281,198,5401,281,71811,284,364,53,1953,94877,1270,256,3651,281,739,48423,284,364,68360,1270,256,3651,320,13990,33437,2406,73066,1319,522,333,1107,333,11,551,1874,11,364,72,1329,415,2794,35939,320,4963,220,16,4393,12232,24309,300,1069,198,1733,5401,1069,1801,100218,284,281,1801,530,316,5477,198,504,3651,13990,33437,2406,73066,66179,33677,1393,364,364,1393,1069,4795,51228,11,551,1874,11,364,72,7132,415,2794,35939,320,4963,220,16,4393,628,89,21926,295,437,669,303,18274,198,1733,5401,18274,1801,48423,284,281,1801,48423,198,504,3651,13990,33437,2406,73066,7,511,22417,46582,11,551,1874,11,364,72,7132,996,1763,15888,7866,281,1801,48423,16477,198,33416,35913,220,1135,46815,50,27785,280,14196,4077,128009,128006,78191,128